{"title":"2022 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(A_Clever_Explanation_You’ll_Get_Instantly)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1_by_Math-X_(First_understand_the_problem!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1 by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2_(HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2 (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 6</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_7_by_Dr._David\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 7 by Dr. David</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\">Problem 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider these two operations:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/f/a9f3ce0b7f20284ad5a40b223ba9a60ae809247b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} a \\, \\blacklozenge \\, b &amp;= a^2 - b^2\\\\ a \\, \\bigstar \\, b &amp;= (a - b)^2 \\end{align*}\" width=\"124\" height=\"47\" />\nWhat is the output of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/2/332a49dd35236a9c3386b18cd7cb45aedaba2cbb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(5 \\, \\blacklozenge \\, 3) \\, \\bigstar \\, 6?$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"93\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/2/f0269d39b24cefc58e71b59eecd515d36238b623.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } {-}20 \\qquad \\textbf{(B) } 4 \\qquad \\textbf{(C) } 16 \\qquad \\textbf{(D) } 100 \\qquad \\textbf{(E) } 220$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"424\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can find a general solution to any <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/d/69d4287f22335c9421dcadc0214c2fa3c2c9e190.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$((a \\, \\blacklozenge \\, b) \\, \\bigstar \\, c)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"96\" height=\"20\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/1/9b1ead4edbaae012d71fc60a0fb5f97d60ea4a95.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[((a \\, \\blacklozenge \\, b) \\, \\bigstar \\, c)\\]\" width=\"91\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/0/130283c842ecd4a186bfc2a3a91da5d10b49d92e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[=((a^2-b^2) \\, \\bigstar \\, c)\\]\" width=\"130\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/a/0ca0fb3ae428092c4149b4c4afdd2bb3bb2306e0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[=(a^2-b^2-c)^2\\]\" width=\"123\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/d/00dc98219662e298a83f59b9e87e169d34ef4dc5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[=a^4+b^4-(a^2)(b^2)-2(a^2)(c)-(b^2)(a^2)+2(b^2)(c)+c^2\\]\" width=\"441\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/d/4edeffd78b5b1feb3e9fdf7af355cff8ed2829a1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[=5^4+3^4-(5^2)(3^2)-2(5^2)(6)-(3^2)(5^2)+2(3^2)(6)+6^2\\]\" width=\"448\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/5/2358711b9bc73279606f6b4824474e91e457133a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[=625+81-225-300-225+108+36\\]\" width=\"323\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/d/cad27560c19ca35edc6eeac0171d9866b590ad60.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) } 100}\\]\" width=\"93\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p>~megaboy6679\n</p><p>~algebraic_algorithmic \"This is very time wasting\"\n</p><p><br />\n~shirtfast There are unnecessary equations ':(\n</p><p>~shaopl2022 solution 2 guys\n</p><p>To time wasting\n</p><p>just go to solution 2\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The problem is basically ((5^2-3^2)-6)^2\n</p><p>=(16-6)^2\n=10^2\n100 = option D\n</p><p>~ Runningmouse\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28A_Clever_Explanation_You.E2.80.99ll_Get_Instantly.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(A_Clever_Explanation_You’ll_Get_Instantly)\">Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/tYWp6fcUAik?si=V8hv_zOn_zYOi9E5&amp;t=74\">https://youtu.be/tYWp6fcUAik?si=V8hv_zOn_zYOi9E5&amp;t=74</a>\n~hsnacademy\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_1_by_Math-X_.28First_understand_the_problem.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1_by_Math-X_(First_understand_the_problem!!!)\">Video Solution 1 by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1 by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/oUEa7AjMF2A?si=JlQdlwkdbIYFNJXj&amp;t=123\">https://youtu.be/oUEa7AjMF2A?si=JlQdlwkdbIYFNJXj&amp;t=123</a>\n</p><p>~Math-X\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_2_.28HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2_(HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY!!!)\">Video Solution 2 (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2 (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ytDV0GNc9Mw\">https://youtu.be/ytDV0GNc9Mw</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_3\">Video Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ij9pAy6tQSg&amp;t=91\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ij9pAy6tQSg&amp;t=91</a>\n~Interstigation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_4\">Video Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/YYuEBGoEK1Y\">https://youtu.be/YYuEBGoEK1Y</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_5\">Video Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Q0R6dnIO95Y?t=53\">https://youtu.be/Q0R6dnIO95Y?t=53</a>\n</p><p>~STEMbreezy\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_6\">Video Solution 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c123kPqd11I\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c123kPqd11I</a>\n</p><p>~harungurcan\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_7_by_Dr._David\">Video Solution 7 by Dr. David</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 7 by Dr. David\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ItPIuHdgyNk\">https://youtu.be/ItPIuHdgyNk</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_SquishBJ_.28AIME_Qualifier.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\">Video Solution by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=G3Eorjc9ztA&amp;t=64s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=G3Eorjc9ztA&amp;t=64s</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8\" title=\"2022 AMC 8\">2022 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2022 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2022 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2022\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2022 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2022 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2022 AMC 8 Problems